Create these files:
1. requirements.txt — fastapi, uvicorn, etc.
2. main.py — FastAPI app entry, includes CORS middleware (allow all origins for dev), mounts all routers, runs on port 8000
3. database.py — SQLite database setup, create tables for categories, transactions, budgets. Pre-seed: income categories (工资,兼职,投资收益,其他收入) and expense categories (餐饮,交通,购物,娱乐,居住,医疗,教育,其他)
4. models.py — Pydantic models for all entities
5. routers/categories.py — CRUD for categories
6. routers/transactions.py — CRUD for transactions with month filtering (?month=YYYY-MM) and pagination (?page=1&page_size=20), return {items, total, page, page_size, total_pages}
7. routers/budgets.py — CRUD for budgets + GET /status endpoint that compares budget vs actual spending, marks over_budget
8. routers/dashboard.py — summary (total income/expense/balance for a month), expense-by-category (for pie chart), monthly-trend (last N months)

