Create these files:
1. index.html — Single page app, includes Chart.js via CDN (https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js), links to css/style.css, and all JS files. Has 4 navigation tabs (仪表盘, 交易记录, 分类管理, 预算管理) and 4 page containers.

2. css/style.css — Modern clean design. Soft colors, card layout, responsive. Include styles for:
   - Navigation bar with active tab highlighting
   - Dashboard summary cards (3 in a row)
   - Chart containers (pie + line side by side)
   - Data tables with hover effects
   - Modal dialog for create/edit forms
   - Pagination controls
   - Budget progress bars (green → yellow → red)
   - Over-budget alert with red blinking
   - Form inputs, buttons, date/month pickers

3. js/api.js — API client wrapping fetch. Base URL http://localhost:8000/api. Functions for every endpoint. Handle errors with alert().

4. js/app.js — App initialization, navigation switching (show/hide pages), hash routing.

5. js/pages/dashboard.js — Render dashboard: fetch summary, expense-by-category, monthly-trend. Use Chart.js for pie (doughnut) and line charts.

6. js/pages/transactions.js — Transaction list with month filter, category filter, pagination. CRUD via modal forms.

7. js/pages/categories.js — Tabbed (收入/支出), list categories, CRUD via modal. Warn on delete if error.

8. js/pages/budgets.js — Month picker, list all expense categories with budget input, show progress bar, over-budget red alert.

9. js/charts.js — Chart.js utility functions for creating/configuring charts.

IMPORTANT:
- Use absolute path: /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/run_test_008/frontend
- All text in Chinese (中文)
- Clean, modern UI design
- Responsive layout
